	// THE INTEGRATION API'S EMPLOYEE (M11 API-6; ADR 0028 §9, K-14, K-15, K-16, K-18, K-21, K-24).
	// internal/domain/tenant (staffapi.go) is the one caller; it runs these inside the API's write
