	// 🔴 K-39 / SECTION 4.7 -- WHAT IT DOES NOT SELECT: note, trust, ip_match, gps_match, gps_lat,
	// gps_lng, source_ip, matched_sid, policy_context, policy_layer, the venue (location_id or
